data: {"id": "08f19a34734f4c58-thinking-parallel_evidence-1191", "run_id": "08f19a34734f4c58", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 事实（`kubectl_describe`）\n- Pod `aiops-case-v11/workload` **持续处于 Pending 状态**，未进入 Running。\n- 容器 `app` 状态：**Waiting，Reason = `CreateContainerConfigError`**，Restart Count = 0。\n- 容器命令：`python3 -u -c \"import time; print('application started', flush=True); time.sleep(86400)\"`，无 VolumeMount。\n- **关键事件**（kubelet 重复 12 次，时间跨度 26 分钟）：\n  > `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input`\n\n### Metrics 事实（`execute_pod_promql`）\n- `kube_pod_container_s", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789360690170, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

