data: {"id": "08f19a34734f4c58-final", "run_id": "08f19a34734f4c58", "seq": 1196, "ts_ms": 1789360706850, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-v11/workload 的容器配置中引用了 ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key'，导致 kubelet 在启动容器时校验失败，触发 CreateContainerConfigError 并使 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Event Failed: Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` (12次, 24m-26m) | 直接证据：kubelet 明确指出因 ConfigMap 缺少 key 而校验失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending` (fact-50a7b0ffc17f) | 现象：Pod 因容器创建失败而停滞在启动前状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Pod 网络状态：`cni.projectcalico.org/podIP: 172.16.104.60/32` (fact-3c631905b3c1) | 排除 CNI 网络故障，Pod 网络分配正常，问题限定在容器运行时/配置层 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=CreateContainerConfigError, value=1) | 指标印证：Prometheus 侧状态与 K8s Event 中的错误原因完全一致 |\n\n**证据总结：**\nK8s 事件明确指出了具体的配置错误（找不到 ConfigMap 的 key），Metric 状态进一步确认了该错误导致的容器状态。由于容器从未成功启动，Logging 和 Tracing 为空（事实层面预期结果），证据链仅依赖 K8s 状态与事件即可完成判定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用不存在的 ConfigMap key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 校验容器配置失败 → 容器状态卡住 Waiting (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 配置错误**：Pod `aiops-case-v11/workload` 在其容器配置中引用了 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中不存在的 Key `'unavailable-key'` [1]。\n\n这一错误导致 `kubelet` 在创建容器前无法完成配置解析，进而触发了 `CreateContainerConfigError`。该机制直接表现为容器启动失败，使 Pod 无法从 `Pending` 状态进入 `Running` 状态 [2][3]。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 556.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 556.8s (Evidence 548.3s, RCA 8.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 583.069, "metrics": {"run_id": "08f19a34734f4c58", "mttr": {"value": "9.7m", "seconds": 583.0755743980408, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 583075.5743980408, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 578078.1011581421, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 12347.050905227661, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4713.555812835693}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18178.01833152771, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发